T11:25:42+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f29e67bb-a130-4a9c-bc6c-5f91c8ca276a","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2019-02-17T15:18:46+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"426450e0-57af-409d-a9e3-898688b9a484","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2019-02-11T13:19:52+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":21,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:30:05.110Z"},"ae6523e8-8939-45d0-91cd-c595b8ca7184":{"id":"ae6523e8-8939-45d0-91cd-c595b8ca7184","title":"In Holy Acrimony","altTitle":"The Fake Was Abandoned","description":"Since being marked as a saint at the tender age of 8, Gloria has been slaying demons and healing soldiers on the battlefield. That is, until one day, the Empire decides to cast her aside in favor of a new, more docile saint by framing her as a fake. Quick to switch to solution mode, Gloria assembles a motley crew and sets up a plan to take revenge on those who wronged her. With her hunky acolytes and her trusted mace in hand, can she restore her honor and make the damned rascals pay?\n___\n[I don't care if she's a fake saint, I have a trusted ally and the power to take revenge.]\n\nFor many years I lived as a healer for the heroes of the Empire. I've participated in countless demon slayings and shed blood countless times. Until one day, a woman claimed to be a real saint.\n\n\"How could you have fooled me for so long?\"\n\n\"I can't believe it. Don't you know shame?\"\n\nThen, as if waiting, everyone turned away from me. Pointing fingers at me, calling me a fake. Yeah, it's dirty, it's mean, and I'm done. I threw the mace on the floor, and the hard marble floor shattered in an instant.","year":2023,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"84","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/ae6523e8-8939-45d0-91cd-c595b8ca7184/feedb7a2-4916-4b5d-8b04-0665ce1c19e1.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","pt-br"],"lane":"man